  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>99</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math> all are divisible by <math><mn>100</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br />and&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>576</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>617</mn></math><br />So, when divided by <math><mn>100</mn></math>, the remainder obtained will be&nbsp;<math><mn>17</mn><mo>.</mo></math>",
